<div class="content">
    <h2>🎉 Welcome to {{courseName}}!</h2>
    
    <p>Hello {{studentName}},</p>
    
    <p>You've successfully enrolled in <strong>{{courseName}}</strong>. We're excited to have you in the class!</p>
    
    <div style="background: rgba(249, 250, 251, 0.7); border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0;">
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #4f46e5;">Course Details</h3>
        <p><strong>Instructor:</strong> {{instructorName}}</p>
        <p><strong>Start Date:</strong> {{startDate}}</p>
        <p><strong>Schedule:</strong> {{schedule}}</p>
        <p><strong>Access Link:</strong> <a href="{{courseLink}}" style="color: #4f46e5;">Go to Course</a></p>
    </div>
    
    <p>To get the most out of this course, we recommend:</p>
    <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin: 10px 0;">
        <li>Review the course materials before each class</li>
        <li>Participate in discussions and activities</li>
        <li>Complete assignments on time</li>
        <li>Reach out to your instructor if you have any questions</li>
    </ul>
    
    <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
        <a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" class="button" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e5 0%, #7c3aed 100%);">
            Go to My Dashboard
        </a>
    </div>
    
    <p>We're here to support your learning journey. If you have any questions, please don't hesitate to contact us at <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}" style="color: #4f46e5; text-decoration: none;">{{supportEmail}}</a>.</p>
    
    <p>Happy Learning!<br>The {{appName}} Team</p>
</div>
